    "body": " \r\n\r\nFrom: Chartering <chartering@elkenz.com> \r\nSent: Monday, 1 July 2024 09:54\r\nTo: Chartering <chartering@elkenz.com>\r\nSubject: ELKENZ MARITIME // HOME TONNAGE\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n+++Please do not recirculate+++\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nGreetings from Elkenz Maritime;\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nPls offer suitable cargoes for our home tonnages;\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nM/V CANKA\r\n\r\nStatus: SPOT @ Constanta\r\n\r\n3,200 dwt\r\n\r\nGearless\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHo/Ha - 1/1\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nM/V SARDES\r\n\r\nStatus: Open @ Constanta 02 - 03 July\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n6,500 dwt\r\n\r\n  Gearless\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n   Ho/Ha - 2/2 / Tween\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nM/V TEAM SPIRIT\r\n\r\nStatus: Open @ Alexandria 03 - 05 July\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n4,820 dwt\r\n\r\n2 x 50ts cranes (100ts in combi)\r\n\r\n   Ho/Ha - 1/1\r\n\r\n   Box / Tween\r\n\r\n  M/V TEOS\r\n\r\n  Status: Open @ Istanbul 15 - 17 July                     4,900 dwt\r\n2 x 50ts cranes                  Ho/Ha - 1/1\r\n\r\n \r\n(100ts in combi)                Box / Tween\r\n\r\nFurther details of the vessels:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n++\r\n\r\nMV CANKA (ex VIRTSU)\r\n\r\nMultipurpose dry cargo vessel ,Panama flag, port of registry: Panama\r\n\r\nBuilt in Holland 1995 ,Lloyd's Register + 100A1, Ice class 1A, +LMC, UMS\r\n,IMO No.: 9103740\r\n\r\n3200 mt DWAT sfb on 4,63m  about 3000 mt TDWCC\r\n\r\nLOA 90,67 m - beam 15,80 m ,GT/NT 2658/1216 ,open hatch/doubleskinned\r\nsingledecker, steelfloored\r\n\r\nabout 140.000 cbf gr/bl (3990 cbm) ,Pointload: tanktop 7,5 mt/m2 and  on\r\nhatch 1,75 mt / m2\r\n\r\nIMO fitted, mechanical holdventilation 10 times/hour\r\n\r\nfitted with smokedetection system in holds.\r\n\r\nCO2 firefigthing system fitted in holds and engineroom.\r\n\r\n1 hold, 1 hatch, MacGregor hatchcover hydr. folding type\r\n\r\nhatch dimensions: 57,50 x 12,80 m\r\n\r\nwith 2 sections folding forward and aft resp.\r\n\r\nG e a r l e s s\r\n\r\nAirdraft ballast 24,7 meter\r\n\r\nP & I club: Shipowner P&I club\r\n\r\nAll details are 'About'\r\n\r\n++\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n++\r\n\r\nMV SARDES (ex AMKE)\r\n\r\nType: Multi Purpose Cargo Vessel\r\n\r\nFlag: Panama \r\n\r\nLength o.a.: abt. 115.50 m Length p.p.: abt. 111.63 m Beam abt.: 16.50 m\r\nDraft abt.: 5.70 m Depth moulded abt.: 7,95 m\r\n\r\nDWAT/DWCC: abt 6500/5800 mt\r\n\r\nGT / NT: Abt. 5313 / 2382\r\n\r\nGearless \r\n\r\nNo. of Ho / Ha: 2/2\r\n\r\nType of Hatches: pontoon type,\r\n\r\nopened by means of gantry cranes\r\n\r\nHold dimensions\r\n\r\nNo. 1    abt. 19.72 m x 13.50 m x 09.05 m No. 2    abt. 57.80 m x 13.50 m x\r\n09.05 m Vessel is fitted with 2 moveable bulkheads in hold no. 2 and full\r\ntweendeck in hold 1 and 2\r\n\r\nVentilation: 6 airchanges p/h of empty cargo hold Bowthruster 1 x abt. 350\r\nkW Hold volume: abt. 308.000 cbft \r\n\r\nAll details are 'about'.\r\n\r\n++\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n++\r\n\r\nMV TEAM SPIRIT (ex MV THOR INGEBORG)\r\n\r\nBuilt in Poland June 1997,Panama flag , Mpp geared/boxshaped ship with\r\nadjustable tweendeck, 4820 mt DWAT on 6,40 m summer salt water, GT/NT\r\n4078/2009\r\n\r\n1 Hatch 57,80 x 13,40 m - MacGrecor folding type, 4 forward, 4 aft. 6790 cbm\r\n(about 240.000 cbf) bale without tweendeck. About 226.000 cbf incl\r\ntweendeck.\r\n\r\nFull tweendeck is on board.\r\n\r\nEquipped for carriage of containers.\r\n\r\nReefer plug capacity :30 x 40'\r\n\r\n1 boxshaped double skinned cargo hold, narrowing for and slightly aft on\r\ntanktop.\r\n\r\n2 cranes placed port side. Each up to 60 mt lifting capacity (SWL) out\r\nreach: 30 tons: 2,3 to 25 meter, 35 tons: 2,3 to 21,3 meter and 60 tons 4,0\r\nto 12,4 meter.\r\n\r\nAll details are 'about'\r\n\r\n++\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n++\r\n\r\nMV TEOS (ex BBC ICELAND) \r\n\r\nImo No.: 9173331. Build in Xingang Shipyard,China in 1999 \r\n\r\nex name \"BBC Iceland\" \r\n\r\nPanama Flag \r\n\r\nMultipurpose geared/boxshaped ship with adjustable tweendeck \r\n\r\n4900 mt DWAT on 6,40 m summer salt water \r\n\r\nGT/NT 4089/2016 \r\n\r\nLOA 100,60 m, Beam 16,60 m. Depth moulded: 8,10 m \r\n\r\nAirdraft about 37,95 meter(waterline/top of antenna). \r\n\r\nIndian Shipping Registry Class \r\n\r\nEquipped for carriage of containers. \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nabt. 6.800 cbm (240.140 cft) grain/bale without tweendeck. Full tweendeck is\r\non board. \r\n\r\n1 boxshaped double skinned cargo hold, narrowing for and slightly aft on\r\ntanktop. Please see pocket plan. \r\n\r\n1 Hatch 57,80 x 13,40 m - Kvaerner folding type, 4 forward, 4 aft. \r\n\r\nPointloads: Tanktop 17,9 mt/m2, tweendeck and hatch: 2,5 mt/m2 Hold\r\nventilation 30 airchanges. \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n2 cranes placed port side. Each up to 60 mt lifting capacity (SWL) outreach:\r\neach 60 mt / 2,4 - 12,4 m; 35mt / 2,3 - 21,3 m; 30 mt /2,3 - 25,00 m. \r\n\r\nHeavylift spreader on board. \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nFully fitted for upto 390 standard 20 feet containers subject to weights. \r\n\r\nAble to load about 202 containers of 20 feet of 14 mt average weight. \r\n\r\nAble load also highcubes, 45', 48' feet containers. \r\n\r\n40 feet containers: 56 FEU in hold and 122 FEU on deck. \r\n\r\n30 reeferplugs on deck. \r\n\r\nStacking weights: tanktop 72/90 mt for 20/40 feet containers,hatch: 40/50 mt\r\nfor 20 and 40 feet containers. Subject to stability. \r\n\r\nAvailable container- and general lashing equipment as per inventory list. \r\n\r\nAll details are 'about' \r\n\r\n++\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBest Regards\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMr. Mert DARTAR | Operation\r\n\r\n\r\nElkenz Maritime | Your partners at sea\r\n\r\n\r\nTel. (0216) 327 96 86 | +90 531 619 3696\r\n\r\n\r\nFax.(0216) 428 94 60-65-66 \r\n\r\n\r\n <mailto:elkenz@elkenz.com> elkenz@elkenz.com \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n***Please always keep  <mailto:elkenz@elkenz.com> elkenz@elkenz.com in CC on\r\nall e-mails.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-- \r\nThis email has been checked for viruses by AVG antivirus software.\r\nwww.avg.com"
